  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Explanation:\n\nBODMAS RULE:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/337cba09b098a129c60c88ca431dc00f7470bb1b39c1452e8d81688a7d6b6b0e.png] \n\nLet's check each option:\n\nOption 1. ÷, −, =, −, ×, −\n\nGiven equation: (44 * 3) * 9 * 89 * (174 * 29) * 58 \n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒__**(44 ÷ 3)**__ - 9 = 89 - __**(174 × 29)**__ - 58 \n\n⇒14.67 - 9 = 89 - 5046 - 58 \n\n⇒ 5.67 ≠ -5015\n\nOption 2 .+, ÷, +, =, −, ×\n\nGiven equation: (44 * 3) * 9 * 89 * (174 * 29) * 58 \n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒__(44 + 3)__ ÷ 9 + 89 = __(174 - 29)__ × 58 \n\n⇒__**47 ÷ 9**__ + 89 = __**145 × 58**__ \n\n⇒__**5.22 + 89**__ = 8410\n\n⇒ 94.22 ≠ 8410\n\nOption 3. ×, +, =, +, ×, ÷ \n\nGiven equation: (44 * 3) * 9 * 89 * (174 * 29) * 58 \n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒__(44 × 3)__ + 9 = 89 + __(174 × 29)__ ÷ 58 \n\n⇒__132** + 9**__ = 89 + __5046 ÷ 58__ \n\n⇒ 141 = 89 + 87\n\n⇒ 141 ≠ 176\n\nOption 4. ×, +, =, −, ÷, +\n\nGiven equation: (44 * 3) * 9 * 89 * (174 * 29) * 58 \n\nAfter replacing the signs, we get:\n\n⇒__(44 × 3)__ + 9 = 89 - __(174 ÷ 29)__ + 58 \n\n⇒__132 + 9__ = 89 - 6 + 58 \n\n**⇒ 141 = 141**\n\nHence,\" ×, +, =, −, ÷, +\" is the correct answer.",
